{#
  The practical-info email, a week before arrival (§6.29).

  The one reminder that goes to the renter, and it goes by email because a
  renter has no account and therefore no notification centre — that is the
  distinction §6.29 is emphatic about.

  Deliberately carries no tracking link: this email is a reminder, not a new
  authorisation, and the renter already has their link from the
  acknowledgement. Re-sending it here would put a capability into an email
  nobody asked for.
#}
{% extends 'email/base.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#212529;">Votre séjour approche</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Bonjour {{ renter_name }},</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
        Votre séjour à <strong>{{ asset_name }}</strong> approche : arrivée le {{ arrival_date }},
        départ le {{ departure_date }}. Votre référence reste <strong>{{ reference }}</strong>.
    </p>
    {% if timing_note %}
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">{{ timing_note }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% if contacts %}
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Vos contacts sur place :</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:12px 16px;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:6px;">{{ contacts|nl2br }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% if emergency_phone %}
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
            En cas d'urgence pendant votre séjour : <strong>{{ emergency_phone }}</strong>.
        </p>
    {% endif %}
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6c757d;">
        Nous nous réjouissons de vous accueillir.
    </p>
{% endblock %}
